<!--
  Monochrome layer for Android 13+ themed icons. The system reads only the alpha channel and
  repaints it with the theme/wallpaper color, so every fill here must be pure white and the
  shapes must stay readable as a silhouette.

  V10-C（用户 2026-09-26）：移除卡牌边框 —— 与 PNG 图标保持一致，只留五角星 + 圆点剪影。
  几何与 tools/gen_launcher_icon.py 同源（星：CX=50 CY=50 外径24 内径9.8 顶点朝正上；
  圆点：中心 75,75 半径 6.6）。改形状时两处必须同步，否则 themed icon 与常规图标会不一致。
-->
